OL,3,GNEWSAExtremist convicted of preparing
OL,4,Aacts of terrorism
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who attempted to join the
OL,7,Fso-called Islamic State (IS) has been
OL,8,Ffound guilty of preparing acts of
OL,9,Fterrorism.
OL,11,FMohamed Mohamoud, who was born in
OL,12,FSomalia but moved to Bristol in 2020,
OL,13,Fpreviously admitted that he flew back
OL,14,Fto his home country in January 2025 and
OL,15,Ftried to join the terrorist
OL,16,Forganisation as a "martyr", but failed
OL,17,Fto reach the group because of ongoing
OL,18,FUK counter-terrorism operations.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
