OL,3,GNEWSAExtremist convicted of preparing
OL,4,Aacts of terrorism
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the trial, the court heard the
OL,7,F22-year-old became interested in
OL,8,Freligion and joining the Islamic State
OL,9,Fin Somalia (Isis) after he watched
OL,10,F"extreme" videos on YouTube and TikTok.
OL,12,FThe prosecution at Winchester Crown
OL,13,FCourt, said: "He aspired not simply to
OL,14,Fjoin Isis, but he aspired to
OL,15,Fmartyrdom."
